%% Source conflict resolution: retain evidence, select, never average (A05).
flowchart TD
  A[New observation for aircraft X] --> B{Track has a selected source?}
  B -- no --> C[Select this source<br/>reason = SingleSource]
  B -- yes --> D{Same source as current?}
  D -- yes --> E[Keep source<br/>reason = BetterRecency]
  D -- no --> F{Compare declared trust}
  F -- new higher --> G[Switch to new source<br/>reason = HigherTrust]
  F -- new lower --> H[Keep current source<br/>reason = HigherTrust]
  F -- equal --> I{Newer event time?}
  I -- yes --> J[Switch to new source<br/>reason = BetterRecency]
  I -- no --> K[Keep current source]
  C --> Z[Both/all positions retained as Evidence]
  E --> Z
  G --> Z
  H --> Z
  J --> Z
  K --> Z
  Z --> Y[Position is one source's value, never an average of datums]
